"Enter the name of the directory where\n"
"the web pages are located.\n"
msgstr ""
"输入网页所在的\n"
"目录名称。\n"

#: pws-0.5/pws/addwizard.cpp:203
msgid "Directory:"
msgstr "目录:"

#: pws-0.5/pws/addwizard.cpp:268
msgid ""
"Enter a port for this server.\n"
"The port is part of the URL for the server\n"
"for example, in http://my.server.org:800\n"
"800 is the port number.\n"
"The standard port for web servers is 80\n"
"To use a port number under 1024 you will \n"
"need the root password."
msgstr ""
"输入此服务器的端口。\n"
"端口是服务器 URL 的一部分,\n"
"例如 http://my.server.org:800 中\n"
"800 就是端口号。\n"
"Web 服务器的标准端口是 80。\n"
"要使用 1024 以下的端口号,\n"
"您需要 root 密码。"

#: pws-0.5/pws/addwizard.cpp:280
msgid "Port Number:"
msgstr "端口号:"

#: pws-0.5/pws/addwizard.cpp:317
msgid ""
"You have finished configuring\n"
"the web server.\n"
"Press OK to save it, Cancel to\n"
"forget about it.\n"
msgstr ""
"您已完成 Web 服务器的配置。\n"
"按“确定”保存,按“取消”\n"
"放弃更改。\n"

